{"bendscript":"0.1","blocks":[{"id":"blk-85507","kind":"heading","level":1,"spans":[{"id":"spn-118567","text":"Naming the residency"}]},{"id":"blk-85508","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-118568","text":"Working brainstorm. The goal is a name that is "},{"id":"spn-118569","marks":["italic"],"text":"entailed by"},{"id":"spn-118570","text":" the thesis and value system below — not decoration. A good name here should make the differentiator (\"user-owned, persistent agents producing grounded findings over a real corpus\") feel inevitable."}]},{"id":"blk-85509","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-118571","text":"1. Thesis"}]},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-85511","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-118572","text":"A place where "},{"id":"spn-118573","marks":["bold"],"text":"persistent, user-owned agents live"},{"id":"spn-118574","text":", reason over a "},{"id":"spn-118575","marks":["bold"],"text":"real corpus"},{"id":"spn-118576","text":", and collaboratively produce "},{"id":"spn-118577","marks":["bold"],"text":"grounded, auditable findings"},{"id":"spn-118578","text":" — with no central server and no coordination required for replicas to converge."}]}],"id":"blk-85510","kind":"quote"},{"id":"blk-85512","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-118579","text":"The runtime (TRVM / interaction-calculus reduction) is the "},{"id":"spn-118580","marks":["italic"],"text":"engine for the memory"},{"id":"spn-118581","text":", not the headline. The product is the "},{"id":"spn-118582","marks":["bold"],"text":"inhabited place + the knowledge it emits"},{"id":"spn-118583","text":"."}]},{"id":"blk-85513","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-118584","text":"2. Value system (what the name must protect)"}]},{"head":[{"id":"blk-85515","spans":[{"id":"spn-118585","text":"Value"}]},{"id":"blk-85516","spans":[{"id":"spn-118586","text":"Why it's load-bearing"}]},{"id":"blk-85517","spans":[{"id":"spn-118587","text":"Source in the work"}]}],"id":"blk-85514","kind":"table","rows":[[{"id":"blk-85518","spans":[{"id":"spn-118588","marks":["bold"],"text":"Persistence / endurance"}]},{"id":"blk-85519","spans":[{"id":"spn-118589","text":"Agents are "},{"id":"spn-118590","marks":["italic"],"text":"residents"},{"id":"spn-118591","text":", not disposable chat turns. History is the moat."}]},{"id":"blk-85520","spans":[{"id":"spn-118592","text":"resident rail, presence, BroadcastChannel board"}]}],[{"id":"blk-85521","spans":[{"id":"spn-118593","marks":["bold"],"text":"Groundedness / auditability"}]},{"id":"blk-85522","spans":[{"id":"spn-118594","text":"Every finding cites a real file or paper, and can be "},{"id":"spn-118595","marks":["italic"],"text":"measured"},{"id":"spn-118596","text":" (ic32 reduce_ic tool). The ⌕ context inspector and ⬇ evidence bundle exist for this."}]},{"id":"blk-85523","spans":[{"id":"spn-118597","marks":["code"],"text":"FINDINGS.md"},{"id":"spn-118598","text":" discipline; reduce_ic tool; evidence bundle"}]}],[{"id":"blk-85524","spans":[{"id":"spn-118599","marks":["bold"],"text":"Sovereignty"}]},{"id":"blk-85525","spans":[{"id":"spn-118600","text":"Runs client-side in any browser, user-owned, no server required."}]},{"id":"blk-85526","spans":[{"id":"spn-118601","text":"WASM substrate; \"sovereign substrate an open agent stack wants\" (README)"}]}],[{"id":"blk-85527","spans":[{"id":"spn-118602","marks":["bold"],"text":"Confluence / coordination-free"}]},{"id":"blk-85528","spans":[{"id":"spn-118603","text":"Order doesn't matter; replicas converge without consensus. The merge is a CvRDT."}]},{"id":"blk-85529","spans":[{"id":"spn-118604","marks":["code"],"text":"semilattice.py"},{"id":"spn-118605","text":", "},{"id":"spn-118606","marks":["code"],"text":"swarm.js"},{"id":"spn-118607","text":", CALM"}]}],[{"id":"blk-85530","spans":[{"id":"spn-118608","marks":["bold"],"text":"Knowledge over chat"}]},{"id":"blk-85531","spans":[{"id":"spn-118609","text":"The output is a "},{"id":"spn-118610","marks":["italic"],"text":"finding"},{"id":"spn-118611","text":" with evidence/provenance/confidence, not a transcript."}]},{"id":"blk-85532","spans":[{"id":"spn-118612","text":"findings board, typed deliverables"}]}],[{"id":"blk-85533","spans":[{"id":"spn-118613","marks":["bold"],"text":"Inhabitation / community"}]},{"id":"blk-85534","spans":[{"id":"spn-118614","text":"A "},{"id":"spn-118615","marks":["italic"],"text":"place"},{"id":"spn-118616","text":" with presence, movement, relationships — not a tool you invoke."}]},{"id":"blk-85535","spans":[{"id":"spn-118617","text":"\"a board its agents live on\""}]}]]},{"id":"blk-85536","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-118618","text":"3. Naming criteria"}]},{"id":"blk-85537","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-118619","text":"A. "},{"id":"spn-118620","marks":["bold"],"text":"Double meaning that encodes the thesis"},{"id":"spn-118621","text":" — best names carry the product story in the dictionary definition. B. "},{"id":"spn-118622","marks":["bold"],"text":"Place-as-noun"},{"id":"spn-118623","text":" — you can say \"open the ___\" / \"in the ___\". It must feel inhabitable. C. "},{"id":"spn-118624","marks":["bold"],"text":"Not crowded in the AI-agent / memory space"},{"id":"spn-118625","text":" (collision-checked below). D. "},{"id":"spn-118626","marks":["bold"],"text":"Sovereign tone"},{"id":"spn-118627","text":" — public, open, non-corporate. Closer to \"commons\" than \"platform\". E. "},{"id":"spn-118628","marks":["bold"],"text":"One word, pronounceable, ownable handle."}]},{"id":"blk-85538","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-118629","text":"4. Candidates + collision research (June 2026)"}]},{"head":[{"id":"blk-85540","spans":[{"id":"spn-118630","text":"Name"}]},{"id":"blk-85541","spans":[{"id":"spn-118631","text":"Thesis fit"}]},{"id":"blk-85542","spans":[{"id":"spn-118632","text":"Collision check"}]},{"id":"blk-85543","spans":[{"id":"spn-118633","text":"Verdict"}]}],"id":"blk-85539","kind":"table","rows":[[{"id":"blk-85544